  "contentPages" : [
    "The Protectorate calls it Ruin.Letheia calls it a resource. The enlightened call it the Unraveling.
    
    It is the slow, inevitable sunset of all structures. Do not weep for the falling star; celebrate its descent. 
    
    For in its collapse, it scatters the seeds of new forms.
    
    We do not worship destruction for the sake of pain, but for the sake of release. 
    
    To be unmade is to be reborn in the great cosmic solvent. 
    
    Amen to the entropy.
"
